  "_sText": "ーーーーーーーーーーー<br><h1 class=\"SelectedElement\"><span class=\"RedColor\">This mod requires <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/tools/17467\" target=\"_blank\">ZZMI</a>, I am unable to provide support for anything else.</span></h1><h1><span class=\"RedColor\">This mod also requires <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/531649\">RabbitFX</a> for her glow to work. You can download it <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/531649\">HERE</a>.</span></h1><h1><span class=\"RedColor\">This game has several LOD based on your GPU specs.<br></span><span class=\"RedColor\">Please look at <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/polls/4170\">THIS POST</a> to test whether or not your GPU will load lower LOD models.<br></span><span class=\"RedColor\">I am currently working on looking for the hashes for the lower LODs.</span></h1>ーーーーーーーーーーー<br>Default keybind<br><br>H - Toggle Skirt<br>Y - Toggle Colour<br>N - Toggle Glow<br>ーーーーーーーーーーー<br><br>Hey everyone!<br><br>I was feeling a bit prolific while making the Nicole mod so I decided to make one for Ellen as well.<br><br><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6696c0f83400f.jpg\"><br><br>I've been wanting to make a maid mod for a long time and this was the perfect opportunity.<br><br><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6696c0f6a81d0.jpg\"><br><br>This turned out much better than I expected, the bounce in this game is absolutely amazing.<br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/02qzUTY.gif\"><br><br>Here are some extra shots.<br><br><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6696c0f91e5b3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6696c0fadea57.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6696c0f545cec.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6696c0f7c94dc.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6696d051e4d23.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6696c0f42b4f5.jpg\"><br><br>I'm not really entirely sure what to do about her skirt... If people like this enough I'll give it some more thought.<br><br>ーーーーーーーーーー<br><br>I've figured out how I want the skirt to look, it's been completely reworked, check it out.<br><br><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/669834ea2513d.jpg\" width=\"100%\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/669834ea2513d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/669834ea120c6.jpg\" width=\"100%\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/66983527b0035.jpg\" width=\"100%\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/66983553e5764.jpg\" width=\"100%\"><br><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/669836af95f19.jpg\"><br><br>A few action shots<br><br><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6698392ccd435.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6698392c95b2e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/669839c8b8f36.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/669839c8866d8.jpg\"><br><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/669839aaea698.jpg\"><br><br>I think I've nailed it for this one.<br><br>ーーーーーーーーーー<br><br>Wow, we got 1000 likes! Thank you for all your support!! (´▽`ʃ♡ƪ)<br><br>As thanks, I've given her a rework. Check it out!<br><br><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/66bd7184599ad.jpg\"><br><br>I've given her an extra toggle, an extra white shark motif colour palette, and given her some glowy bits as requested by some.<br><br><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/66bd7171ed4d0.jpg\"><br><br>She looks so beautifully menacing with all these additions.<br><br><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/66bd721292d8b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/66bd72127825d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/66bd72125c8c7.jpg\"><img src=\"https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/66bd72127479c.jpg\"><br><br>Once again, thank you for all your support and I hope you will continue supporting me in the future!",
